                                        "entry_id": "9504061d-c486-301e-ab4b-056ceb8de296",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Initialism of homosexual transsexual, a term in Blanchard's discredited transsexualism typology for a trans woman who is attracted to men."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "initialism"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77d64320-2227-4364-a26f-f3c9cb3a4f8b",
                                                "sense_id": "8afc782c-4122-382b-a5c0-6e357ddff987",
                                                "text": "I was being flip with the dinner-date suggestion. And my age would surely provoke some discussion relative to the HSTS and AG thing which I'd rather not go into."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78e4915d-3764-4e20-b5af-e113ae55e0bc",
                                                "sense_id": "8afc782c-4122-382b-a5c0-6e357ddff987",
                                                "text": "HSTS start out as homosexual, gender variant, not very well adjusted or socially and sexually successful boys, and hopefully end up as heterosexual, gender normative, well adjusted and socially acceptable girls."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1d3648c-d9cd-497b-afc4-7c8bd3c3ccbb",
                                                "sense_id": "8afc782c-4122-382b-a5c0-6e357ddff987",
                                                "text": "A downside to being an HSTS transsexual is that quite often, the only frame of reference you have for what to means to be an HSTS is yourself."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13fa42f5-88b5-4786-8303-9e8caf067246",
                                                "sense_id": "8afc782c-4122-382b-a5c0-6e357ddff987",
                                                "text": "If this is true, I believe the following: HSTS are not the opposite natal sex in any way, nor do they have opposite-sexed brains."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
